<title>UK: Soco shares gain in short squeeze.</title>
<headline>Soco shares gain in short squeeze.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in oil exploration firm Soco International gained 30-1/2 pence to 332-1/2 in high volumes with buyers finding it hard to find sellers.</p>
<p>Dealers described trading conditions as &quot;squeezy&quot;, but failed to point to a specific reason behind today's buying interest.</p>
<p>In late afternoon trading, just over 723,023 shares had changed hands, compared with a more normal turnover of 15,000 shares on Monday.</p>
<p>Soco was floated late in May through a placing at 260 pence a share.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
